OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds die of drug misuse across
OL,4,AWest Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal leaders are preparing to set out
OL,7,Fhow they intend to tackle rising
OL,8,Fdrugb@Qmisuse deaths across the West
OL,9,FMidlands.
OL,11,FFigures show more than 600 people in
OL,12,Fthe region died over a twob@Qyear
OL,13,Fperiod, according to the West Midlands
OL,14,FState of the Region 2026 report.
OL,16,FIt said there were 9,697 deaths from
OL,17,Fdrug misuse nationally between 2022 and
OL,18,F2024, and 613 of these were from
OL,19,FBirmingham, Coventry, Dudley, Sandwell,
OL,20,FSolihull, Walsall and Wolverhampton.
